{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"奇异单纯集"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"奇异单纯集"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>拓扑空间的奇异单纯集是一种"},{"Local":{"url":"脉","text":"脉"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>奇异单纯集函子是"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":"的右伴随.</p>\n"}]}}